    <string name="settings_audio_passthrough_description">On: Dolby and DTS go undecoded to the TV, soundbar or receiver when it says it can play them (ExoPlayer). Off: the app decodes them, still as surround where Surround sound allows. mpv always decodes. Not used while Night mode or Volume levelling is on.</string>
    <string name="settings_audio_passthrough_description_mobile">On: Dolby and DTS go undecoded to a connected TV or receiver when it says it can play them (ExoPlayer). Off: the app decodes them, still as surround where Surround sound allows. mpv always decodes. Not used while Night mode or Volume levelling is on.</string>
